# For Model-Deployment/refresh/Dockerfile only (Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile in
# place of the repo's .dockerignore). Allowlist: only what the Dockerfile COPYs reaches the build. A new COPY needs
# a ! line. Data (snapshots/, out/, published/) never goes in the image: the job pulls it at run time.
*
!Data-Pipeline/requirements.txt
!Data-Pipeline/meridian/*.py
!Data-Pipeline/meridian.toml
!Data-Pipeline/settings.toml
!Data-Pipeline/schema.sql
!Data-Pipeline/KNOWLEDGE-BASE.md
!Model-Pipeline/requirements.txt
!Model-Pipeline/model.toml
!Model-Pipeline/model/*.py
!Model-Pipeline/registry/champion.json
!Model-Deployment/deploy.toml
!Model-Deployment/deploy_config.py
!Model-Deployment/refresh/*.py
!Model-Deployment/monitor/*.py
!Model-Deployment/monitor/monitor.toml
